<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The years 99–1 BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 1st century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the years 99–1 BCE, 320 states of the register existed somewhere in the world. 61 were founded and 166 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Han Dynasty, the Roman Republic and the Parthian Empire.</p></header>
